  Placement: 1
  CardStory: "2Spade takes his tea with a dollop of honey. It doesn\u2019t calm him
    anymore, but the habit is hard to shake. 2Club is here, of course she is. 2Spade
    and 2Club often spend time together. *She is always there when I need her.* It
    smells like ash and vocal chords ripping.\r\n\r\nNo, it smells like tea. *What
    is a smell, again?*\r\n\r\nThey drink together. *2Club pours some honey in their
    cups.* Wait. That makes no sense. \r\n\r\nShe wouldn\u2019t do that."
